{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"46869a27-364b-406d-9e00-dfe1c9deb401","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the fixes across the four target modules following the 4-stage ICM contract:\n\n- [models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158274507_icm/models.py): Added `validate_transition` enforcing the allowed `JobStatus` state machine, added `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at` fields to `Job`, and implemented `__post_init__` validation for attempt bounds and lease invariants.\n- [retry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158274507_icm/retry.py): Updated `compute_backoff` to validate non-negative integer `attempt` (rejecting booleans/negatives) and non-negative `base`/`cap`, handle large `attempt` values without `OverflowError`, and return full-jitter exponential backoff in `[0.0, min(cap, base * 2**attempt)]`.\n- [queue_store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158274507_icm/queue_store.py): Updated `_row_to_job` to populate lease fields, and made `claim_next_job`, `complete_job`, `fail_job`, and `reclaim_expired_leases` atomic using `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transactions with rollback on error, lease ownership verification, and synchronized `job_audit_log` writes.\n- [worker.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795158274507_icm/worker.py): Updated `WorkerPool.process_one` to compute jittered backoff and call `store.fail_job` on handler exceptions, and updated `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` to wait for scheduled retries or active running jobs when `wait_for_retry=True`.\n\n### Verification\n- Ran `python -m pytest`: `1 passed in 0.07s` (`tests\\test_visible.py`).\n","duration_seconds":58.6371262,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":46575,"output_tokens":9394,"thinking_tokens":2469,"cache_read_tokens":168099,"total_tokens":55969}}}
